  "result": "The change is in place: vitest passes 637 of 637 (74 files, up from 617 at baseline), `tsc --noEmit` is clean, and eslint is clean on the touched files. I did not use git.\n\nChoices I made where the spec was silent:\n- Milestone names are stored trimmed, and a whitespace-only name is rejected by the schema.\n- Moving an issue emits `issue.updated` with `changedFields: [\"milestoneId\"]`. Moving to the milestone it is already in is a no-op with no event.\n- The new `milestones` table and `issues.milestone_id` column are in the embedded migration SQL only. Existing databases built before this change will not get them, since the migration has no `ALTER`.\n- I added no UI or server actions, since the spec lists only the service-layer API.",
